Perfect! Here's a **complete summary of all valid request bodies** for all frequency types that you can share with the Frontend team.

---

# 📋 Schedule Preview API - Complete Request Bodies

## Base URL
```
POST /api/schedule/preview
```

---

## 1. ONCE - Single Release

### Payload
```json
{
  "targetAmount": 30000,
  "releaseAmount": 30000,
  "frequencyType": 1,
  "frequencyConfig": "{\"type\":1,\"onceDate\":\"2026-09-04T00:00:00\",\"time\":\"10:30\"}",
  "startDate": "2026-09-04T00:00:00+01:00",
  "maxReleases": 10
}
```

### Sample Response Dates
```json
[
  {
    "date": "2026-09-04T10:30:00+01:00",
    "amount": 30000,
    "releaseNumber": 1,
    "cumulativeAmount": 30000
  }
]
```

---

## 2. DAILY - Every Day (All 7 Days)

### Payload
```json
{
  "targetAmount": 30000,
  "releaseAmount": 7000,
  "frequencyType": 2,
  "frequencyConfig": "{\"type\":2,\"daysOfWeek\":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],\"time\":\"10:30\"}",
  "startDate": "2026-09-04T00:00:00+01:00",
  "maxReleases": 10
}
```

### Sample Response Dates
```json
[
  { "date": "2026-09-04T10:30:00+01:00", "amount": 7000, "releaseNumber": 1, "cumulativeAmount": 7000 },
  { "date": "2026-09-05T10:30:00+01:00", "amount": 7000, "releaseNumber": 2, "cumulativeAmount": 14000 },
  { "date": "2026-09-06T10:30:00+01:00", "amount": 7000, "releaseNumber": 3, "cumulativeAmount": 21000 },
  { "date": "2026-09-07T10:30:00+01:00", "amount": 7000, "releaseNumber": 4, "cumulativeAmount": 28000 },
  { "date": "2026-09-08T10:30:00+01:00", "amount": 2000, "releaseNumber": 5, "cumulativeAmount": 30000 }
]
```

---

